WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,230 --> 00:00:02,750
This quantity doesn’t match up

2
00:00:06,470 --> 00:00:08,430
Judging from the corpses currently on the ground

3
00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:13,200
There should be half of the Northern Barbarian cavalry to deal with them.

4
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:16,760
Boy who are you

5
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:19,880
When did recruit Li Dao come here?

6
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:21,480
Come to Huangsha Formation to report

7
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:24,380
Then why are you here

8
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:48,610
How could you come from that direction? What do you know about Xue Bing?

9
00:00:49,250 --> 00:00:51,330
Do you know what is the crime of cheating your superiors?

10
00:00:51,490 --> 00:00:53,610
Boss, I lied to you

11
00:00:53,850 --> 00:00:55,090
I just met him too

12
00:00:55,090 --> 00:01:00,050
This kid can really do it on his own
